An extract of the configuration of a production array, as a v2 agent pushed
it to the old collector, anonymized: the serials of the arrays, the wwn of
their ports and devices, the addresses, the labels, the names of the groups
and pools and the serials of the disks are replaced by fake ones, the same
value always by the same fake, keeping the structure the parsers read. The
array is cut to a subset of its devices.

The rows in ../<this directory>.rows.json are the ones the old collector
made of these outputs (insert_hds or insert_sym, without their database),
with its init/modules parser run under python 2.7.
